| Operators | |
|---|---|
| `/` `%` | Integer division when both sides are int; remainder |
| `==` `!=` `&&` `\|\|` `!` | Comparison and logic (short-circuit) |
| `a ?? b`, `a ??= b`, `a?.b` | Null fallback, assign if null, null-safe access |
| `cond ? a : b` | Conditional |
| `x is int n`, `x is > 0 and < 10` | Patterns |

