## Strings

| Code | Gives |
|---|---|
| `s.Length`, `s[0]`, `s[^1]`, `s[1..4]` | Length, first, last, part |
| `s.Trim()`, `s.ToUpper()`, `s.Replace(a, b)` | New strings |
| `s.Split(',', StringSplitOptions.TrimEntries)`, `string.Join(", ", parts)` | Split, join |
| `s.Contains(x)`, `s.StartsWith(x)`, `s.IndexOf(x)` | Tests, position (-1) |
| `string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(s)` | Blank check |
| `new StringBuilder().Append(x).ToString()` | Build in a loop |
| `@"C:\path"`, `"""raw "quotes" """` | Verbatim and raw strings |

